OL,3,GNEWSAFormer hunt master convicted of
OL,4,Aillegal fox hunting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former master of a hunt in the
OL,7,FBorders has become the first person in
OL,8,FScotland to be sentenced for illegal
OL,9,Ffox hunting under new legislation.
OL,11,FClaire Bellamy, 51, who was a member of
OL,12,FLauderdale Hunt, led a pack of about 17
OL,13,Fhounds in a wooded area between Houston
OL,14,Fin Renfrewshire and Kilmacolm in
OL,15,FInverclyde, in January 2025.
OL,17,FShe had permission for the hunt from
OL,18,FNature Scot, but Paisley Sheriff Court
OL,19,Fheard she allowed the dogs to get the
OL,20,Fscent and then chase a fox through a
OL,21,Ffield outwith the permitted areas of
OL,22,Fher licence.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
